- `targets_unwanted_behavior` — `yes`/`no`: is the plan aimed at DECREASING their unwanted target behavior, rather than the wrong behaviour? Answer what is true of the example even if it turned out to be a different type than this item asks for — where that makes this finding redundant the grader drops it, and it charges nothing twice
